    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tack up, it's time to ride!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create the perfect horse, who will be your partner in practice &amp; competition. Care for your horse as you feed, groom &amp; train to perfect your skills. The more you train together the better you will perform, as you win your way to prestigious international events comprising Show Jumping, Dressage and Cross Country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Multiple difficulty levels for players of all ages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Four officially licensed Grand-Slam Equestrian events: Badminton, Burghley, Adelaide, and Kentucky</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Customise your rider and horse with thousands of combinations to create your own unique duo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Hundreds of unlockable items, including clothes, rosettes and prizes</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tack up, it's time to ride!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create the perfect horse, who will be your partner in practice &amp; competition. Care for your horse as you feed, groom &amp; train to perfect your skills. The more you train together the better you will perform, as you win your way to prestigious international events comprising Show Jumping, Dressage and Cross Country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Multiple difficulty levels for players of all ages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Four officially licensed Grand-Slam Equestrian events: Badminton, Burghley, Adelaide, and Kentucky</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Customise your rider and horse with thousands of combinations to create your own unique duo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Hundreds of unlockable items, including clothes, rosettes and prizes</p>",
